{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resonant is an open world, audiovisual experience. Explore a world that breathes with sound, choosing your musical path to discover all that the landscape has to reveal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand crafted open world that evolves and reacts with your influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685270/extras/a5e7a1e75f147a23612d0642bcc4b709.poster.avif?t=1767670349\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685270/extras/a5e7a1e75f147a23612d0642bcc4b709.webm?t=1767670349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A landscaped filled with a plethora of unique objects for you to interact with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685270/extras/ccd26dfe2dfa3f0df9e5342d2683cb2c.poster.avif?t=1767670349\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685270/extras/ccd26dfe2dfa3f0df9e5342d2683cb2c.webm?t=1767670349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HEAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundscapes and ambiences of a world that breathes and moves with sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685270/extras/3187f2c7e63fa12ad5b5439e802646e5.poster.avif?t=1767670